error[keywords]: `octet` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
   ┌ test.idl:2:11
   │
 2 │ interface octet {           // 'octet' is a keyword
   ·           ^^^^^ this is an IDL keyword
   └──
 help: the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_octet`

error[keywords]: `int8` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
   ┌ test.idl:6:11
   │
 6 │ interface int8 {            // 'int8' is a keyword
   ·           ^^^^ this is an IDL keyword
   └──
 help: the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_int8`
